  "method": {
    "prediction_model": "SingleTrackModel: the dynamic single-track plant's own equations; reduced_single_track for the four-wheel car (no load transfer, aerodynamics, brake bias or wheel speeds); the kinematic bicycle, which has no tires, is refused",
    "horizon": "60 stages of 0.05 s, two RK4 steps each",
    "state": "centre of gravity pose and body velocity, progress station, acceleration, steering, progress rate; inputs their rates",
    "cost": "contouring 0.1 (x10 at the last stage), lag 100, progress reward 1, heading 0.5, sideslip 5, yaw rate 0.01, input values and rates, slack 1000 quadratic and 100 linear",
    "constraints": "corridor less half width and 0.3 m, only the chosen side beside a blockage; each axle's slip angle within 0.7 of its peak; each axle's requested forces within 0.95 of its friction ellipse; top speed, softened by its own slack and falling at 0.5 g from a car above it; steering and its rate",
    "solving": "two SQP steps per decision, forward-difference linearisation of 6 state columns and 2 inputs, step share 0.9, proximal step penalty 1, OSQP tolerance 1e-3 warm-started from the last multipliers, restart from the policy's prediction after two failed decisions",
    "acceptance": "the simulation lets the plan drive only when solved, within its own slip angles and the corridor, clear of every blockage by first_blockage_entered, and not holding; otherwise the policy drives and the decision says why"
  },
